## Third-Party Notices & Acknowledgments

- **dsh-wallpaper-engine** (https://github.com/elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine) — MIT License
  Referenced for Wallpaper Engine `.pkg` container header indexing, Steam library discovery patterns, WebWallGL iframe integration, and WE API shim injection.
- **webwallgl** (https://www.npmjs.com/package/webwallgl) — MIT License
  Used as an npm dependency to render Wallpaper Engine Scene projects directly via WebGL in the client viewport.
- **chuanban-antigravity-theme-patch** (https://github.com/Anarcadia/chuanban-antigravity-theme-patch)
  This repository does NOT redistribute `core/` files from `chuanban-antigravity-theme-patch`. Instead, `install.mjs` fetches and installs the official upstream repository on demand at setup time and integrates cleanly through its non-destructive `user/` extension hooks (`custom.css` / `custom.js`).
